WP4+WP7 final close-out: /trust/ trust center, dedup, generated llms.txt

- Rename /security/ -> /trust/ (template, render route, Worker 301 with
  locale prefix, _redirects, all internal links) and extend the page with
  a shared-facts grid (reuses security.*/arch.* keys), subprocessors
  (Cloudflare, Resend, GA4, Bedrock - code-verifiable), vulnerability
  disclosure pointing at security.txt, and the shared DPA/questionnaire
  route. No invented facts; [CONFIRM] items (entity/emails, compliance
  table, statuses) stay out.
- /trust/ + llms.txt + /architecture/ now share one source: build.sh
  generates llms.txt from marketing/llms.txt prose + en.json facts and a
  full key-pages list (trust/evidence/finance/procurement included).
- Structural fixes: privacy 'On this page' rendered once; terms date
  heading once; /about/ links to /architecture/ + /trust/ instead of
  duplicating the flow (meta.about.title updated in 8 locales); /poc/
  flow include replaced by an architecture link + scope line; contact
  page carries the DPA line.
- Locales: 18 line-scoped key additions per locale (crumb.trust,
  trust.*, poc.scope, about.trust.link, meta.trust.* copied from
  meta.security.*), privacy/terms dates -> 23 November 2026.
- Tests: new tests/test_closeout_gates.py (trust route+worker 301,
  per-locale shared-facts parity, privacy/terms/about dedup regressions,
  generated-llms parity, no stale /security/); updated revision-copy
  tests for the rename and the deduped about/poc pages; CI gains live
  /trust/ 200 + /security/ and /de/security/ 301 checks.
- LANDING_CSS bumped to 165 for the trust-facts styles.
